1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,320
(Sheldon:)There's someone at my door.

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,050
(Amy:)That doesn't interest me.
Good-bye.

3
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:11,920
- Can I sleep here tonight?
- Why?

4
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,590
(Raj:)Leonard's having
astronomically inaccurate

5
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,720
Star Trek sex with my sister.

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,200
(Sheldon:)I can see how that would be
upsetting. Come in.

7
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:22,440
(Sheldon:)I'll get the sheets
and blankets for the couch.

8
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:24,800
(Raj:)Oh, don't bother.
I'll just sleep in Leonard's room.

9
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,370
(Sheldon:)No, I can't authorize that.

10
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:29,210
(Raj:)Well, he's in my bed.
Why can't I be in his?

11
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:31,740
(Sheldon:)The Hammurabic Code is
"an eye for an eye,"

12
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:33,810
not "a bed for a bed."

13
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:36,550
(Raj:)Come on, dude, I'm exhausted,
and Tyra Banks says

14
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:38,750
(Raj:)the most important item in your
makeup bag is

15
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:40,190
(Raj:)a good night's sleep.

16
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,490
(Sheldon:)All right.

17
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:49,000
(Sheldon:)This is a form
indemnifying me

18
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,500
(Sheldon:)from your use of
"Leonard's bedroom."

19
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:55,470
(Sheldon:)Sign here, indicating
that I tried to stop you

20
00:00:55,470 --> 00:01:03,020
(Sheldon:)and did so using
a stern facial expression.

